{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa83067beb7086c73afe37c37c21800c6dfa24e7ef4217d2c4351309cf3da18d",
      "text": "出演旅游资讯节目的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85f51c964376d70d42e61abb053cd1dbf91cdecaded596d1674303df282bf53b",
      "text": "这一带的商业街，老店铺好像很多呢！\n听拍摄工作人员说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8094cda95b92472358560160079402a042e3236f1f53402c6e12969012053a1f",
      "text": "是啊，门面看起来很有年头的店\n似乎不少，感觉能挖出很多故事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336bf66478f1d4cff86f6ece1661fa7483b12a10f1543bd3b9e10091825623ba",
      "text": "是啊。那边看得到的那家日式点心店，\n听说已经开了一百多年了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afdc397c36fcb3558f5d5f5aae4b34a0696149e0664af4f3125ffa7d2437260f",
      "text": "好像还曾经作为将军的\n歇脚处用过呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f084c7079658efe3510e5f3cf639dd488bc5c79aa19de5aff96c8fcbb1bb2a2e",
      "text": "那真是太厉害了！\n说不定会有什么惊人的轶事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afb9075dbeb7383ad82ad6448364d2cc639db3e4a7b5428dcc18377148e2fa7a",
      "text": "哇哈哈！是啊。\n要是采访时能问出点什么就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d2f6270b5e70a3f594f0b501784c298c8054a828673f03f0280c2a0a640df1",
      "text": "不过，也得注意别只把镜头\n集中在日式点心店上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d3884153c50ccc3240eca9dd04c8c70a27697825626d5207a996c38a98160f",
      "text": "其他的店铺肯定也都是\n传承了好多年的老店啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05be5e3c781e408af3791a21ca950938d69a6abbf550f109d7dbbd28d48afcc9",
      "text": "哪怕只能尽一点微薄之力，只要能为坚守家业\n多年的人们打气助威，俺就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_03:1_5_042_03:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f1996830940d2b248c57eae21dd3e460c983d415086cffb05183a786fd6e428",
      "text": "好——！打起精神把每家店的\n魅力都给挖掘出来！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
